{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/nqts3a1s","slide":1,"text":"Weather information is spread across forecast applications, technical dashboards, map services and separate emergency-alert platforms. Users often need to interpret numerical data without receiving a clear explanation of how the conditions affect their location, activity or travel plans. Most applications provide static results and require manual navigation between screens. Weather GPT addresses this gap through an agentic AI assistant that understands user intent, selects trusted weather and alert sources, analyses the retrieved information and presents relevant guidance through text, voice and interactive maps.","textPreview":"Weather information is spread across forecast applications, technical dashboards, map services and separate emergency-alert platforms. Us...","textChars":620,"textLines":1,"bbox":[62,210,373,250]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mp0ru507","slide":1,"text":"PAIN POINTS","textPreview":"PAIN POINTS","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[483,164,340,28]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/9sba5kjy","slide":1,"bbox":[483,196,58,3]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zm9sza1w","slide":1,"text":"Fragmented information","textPreview":"Fragmented information","textChars":22,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,207,324,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/el0rq50b","slide":1,"text":"Current conditions, forecasts, map layers and emergency alerts often appear in separate applications.","textPreview":"Current conditions, forecasts, map layers and emergency alerts often appear in separate applications.","textChars":101,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,225,324,35]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0ni9sfi1","slide":1,"text":"Difficult interpretation","textPreview":"Difficult interpretation","textChars":24,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,260,324,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jidsbu10","slide":1,"text":"Technical maps, measurements and scientific terms can be difficult for ordinary users to understand.","textPreview":"Technical maps, measurements and scientific terms can be difficult for ordinary users to understand.","textChars":100,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,278,324,35]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/udovatkn","slide":1,"text":"Static interaction","textPreview":"Static interaction","textChars":18,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,313,324,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vexc3yl8","slide":1,"text":"Traditional applications show fixed results and provide limited support for follow-up questions.","textPreview":"Traditional applications show fixed results and provide limited support for follow-up questions.","textChars":96,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,331,324,35]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hgfe583e","slide":1,"text":"Limited hands-free access","textPreview":"Limited hands-free access","textChars":25,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,366,324,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2h8vedkj","slide":1,"text":"Manual navigation makes weather information less convenient while travelling, working or handling urgent situations.","textPreview":"Manual navigation makes weather information less convenient while travelling, working or handling urgent situations.","textChars":116,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,384,324,35]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4jqdgn2p","slide":1,"text":"Weak decision support","textPreview":"Weak decision support","textChars":21,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,419,324,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pkze9s3a","slide":1,"text":"Generic forecasts do not explain how weather may affect travel, outdoor work, events or personal safety.","textPreview":"Generic forecasts do not explain how weather may affect travel, outdoor work, events or personal safety.","textChars":104,"textLines":1,"bbox":[518,437,324,35]}
