{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vapc7udw","slide":1,"text":"Weather APIs, geospatial services and official alert feeds may use different formats, update intervals and levels of accuracy.","textPreview":"Weather APIs, geospatial services and official alert feeds may use different formats, update intervals and levels of accuracy.","textChars":126,"textLines":1,"bbox":[62,616,210,68]}
