{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qpoz2xg3","slide":1,"text":"Heatwave assessments must follow defined thresholds, while tsunami warnings must come from authorised sources.","textPreview":"Heatwave assessments must follow defined thresholds, while tsunami warnings must come from authorised sources.","textChars":110,"textLines":1,"bbox":[782,616,210,68]}
